    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6adbe51f6c5d40.44366252\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has released a new Midnight Motion Comic called \"Singularity\", read by Yuri Lowenthal as Arator Windrunner. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/template_resource/WZEDV9Y81ZUY1792526440168.pdf\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Singularity Comic</span></a></div><br><br>This new six minute video has Yuri Lowenthal, the voice of Arator, read the new \"Singularity\" comic written by Robert Brooks. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LyL3u4Q3954/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-gb/news/24313104\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Join Arator Windrunner as he ventures into the depths of the Void with the aid of his mentor, Umbric, in search of clues to his missing parents' fate. As reality twists and dark whispers prey on his mind and fears, he must learn to confront the Void without losing himself to it.<br><br> <b>Read By</b> : Yuri Lowenthal as Arator Windrunner<br><b> Written By </b>: Robert Brooks<br> <b>Art &amp; Cover</b> : Joseph Lacroix<br> <b>Colors</b> :&nbsp;Marco Lacoti<br> <b>Letters</b> : AndWorld Design<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/template_resource/WZEDV9Y81ZUY1792526440168.pdf\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Downloadable PDF</a></b></div><hr>Read more stories and stay up to date on the latest World of Warcraft news at <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/<wbr>news</a>.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has released a new Midnight Motion Comic called &quot;Singularity&quot;, read by Yuri Lowenthal as Arator Windrunner. <br /><br />Singularity Comic<br /><br />This new six minute video has Yuri Lowenthal, the voice of Arator, read the new &quot;Singularity&quot; comic written by Robert Brooks. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Join Arator Windrunner as he ventures into the depths of the Void with the aid of his mentor, Umbric, in search of clues to his missing parents' fate. As reality twists and dark whispers prey on his mind and fears, he must learn to confront the Void without losing himself to it.<br /><br /> <b>Read By</b> : Yuri Lowenthal as Arator Windrunner<br /><b> Written By </b>: Robert Brooks<br /> <b>Art &amp; Cover</b> : Joseph Lacroix<br /> <b>Colors</b> :&nbsp;Marco Lacoti<br /> <b>Letters</b> : AndWorld Design<br /><br /><b><a href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/template_resource/WZEDV9Y81ZUY1792526440168.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">Downloadable PDF</a></b><br /><br />Read more stories and stay up to date on the latest World of Warcraft news at <a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news/\" rel=\"nofollow\">worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/news</a>.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
